      "message": "Per in-person: we should probably do this before we call nai.asyncChannel.connect(). This is so that if we get a message from the NetworkAgent that would cause us to ask NetworkMonitor to do something, we\u0027d send a message to a state machine that is not yet started, and it would crash.",
